stateDiagram-v2
  direction TB
  [*] --> Scheduled: V1 delivery scheduled for a paid or due period
  Scheduled --> Skipped: V2 customer skips before cutoff
  Scheduled --> Cancelled: V3 subscription paused or cancelled before cutoff
  Scheduled --> Frozen: V4 cutoff reached — basket version frozen
  Frozen --> Exception: V5 basket invalid, short stock, slot or payment issue
  Exception --> Frozen: V6 resolved with customer
  Exception --> Skipped: V7 customer agrees to skip
  Frozen --> OrderGenerated: V8 delivery order created (idempotent)
  OrderGenerated --> Delivered: V9 order delivered
  OrderGenerated --> NotDelivered: V10 order returned or cancelled
